{
  "id": "core",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "schemaVersion": 1,

  "_comment": [
    "The context tree. A norm is keyed by (measure, context), and resolution WALKS UP this tree:",
    "no norm for 'driver' falls back to 'full_swing', then to 'any', then to nothing. Authors write",
    "a row only where the value genuinely differs from its parent, which is what keeps a norm set",
    "readable — the contexts that carry their own row are exactly the ones somebody deliberately",
    "distinguished.",
    "",
    "'full_swing' is the DEFAULT: a shot that declares no context resolves here and the finding is",
    "marked inferred.",
    "",
    "The archetype nodes are not shot types. They carry the lead-wrist face corridor that used to be",
    "a compiled +/-10 degree shift in reference_bands.cpp, so a valid bowed or cupped style is graded",
    "against its own model rather than red-flagged. They sit under full_swing because that is what",
    "they refine; a shot resolves to one of them only when the archetype has been detected."
  ],

  "contexts": [
    { "id": "any",          "label": "Any shot" },

    { "id": "full_swing",   "label": "Full swing",        "parent": "any" },
    { "id": "driver",       "label": "Driver",            "parent": "full_swing" },
    { "id": "fairway_wood", "label": "Fairway wood",      "parent": "full_swing" },
    { "id": "wood_3",       "label": "3 wood",            "parent": "fairway_wood" },
    { "id": "wood_5",       "label": "5 wood",            "parent": "fairway_wood" },
    { "id": "hybrid",       "label": "Hybrid",            "parent": "fairway_wood" },

    { "id": "iron",         "label": "Iron",              "parent": "full_swing" },
    { "id": "iron_3",       "label": "3 iron",            "parent": "iron" },
    { "id": "iron_4",       "label": "4 iron",            "parent": "iron" },
    { "id": "iron_5",       "label": "5 iron",            "parent": "iron" },
    { "id": "iron_6",       "label": "6 iron",            "parent": "iron" },
    { "id": "iron_7",       "label": "7 iron",            "parent": "iron" },
    { "id": "iron_8",       "label": "8 iron",            "parent": "iron" },
    { "id": "iron_9",       "label": "9 iron",            "parent": "iron" },

    { "id": "wedge",        "label": "Wedge",             "parent": "full_swing" },
    { "id": "wedge_pitching", "label": "Pitching wedge",  "parent": "wedge" },
    { "id": "wedge_gap",    "label": "Gap wedge",         "parent": "wedge" },
    { "id": "wedge_sand",   "label": "Sand wedge",        "parent": "wedge" },
